WEBVTT

00:04:29.863 --> 00:04:32.963
So there's a really unfair shame,

00:04:32.997 --> 00:04:38.030
shame over having a stigmatized identity
and internalizing that shame,

00:04:38.063 --> 00:04:39.730
for example.

00:04:39.763 --> 00:04:42.297
So people who are, you know,

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:48.263
in one minority group or another
that's stigmatized

00:04:48.263 --> 00:04:50.697
part of the issue is:
Do you buy into that?

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:56.430
Do you buy into that, and I think that's
a really big question to work with.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:01.997
[What strategies can help people change
their shame into guilt and move on?]